{
    "comment": "페이지 문서 보기 — 관리자가 만든 정적 문서(이용약관·소개·FAQ 등)를 슬러그로 찾아 보여 준다. 푸터와 드로어의 정보·정책 링크가 모두 이 한 화면으로 온다.",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "layout_name": "page/show",
    "extends": "_user_base",
    "meta": {
        "title": "{{page?.data?.seo_meta?.title ?? page?.data?.title ?? '$t:user.page.page_title'}}",
        "description": "{{page?.data?.seo_meta?.description ?? ''}}",
        "keywords": "{{page?.data?.seo_meta?.keywords ?? ''}}",
        "seo": {
            "enabled": true,
            "priority": 0.5,
            "changefreq": "monthly",
            "data_sources": [
                "page"
            ],
            "og": {
                "type": "website",
                "title": "{{page.data.title ?? ''}}",
                "description": "{{page.data.seo_meta?.description ?? ''}}",
                "image": "{{page.data.content_thumbnail_url ?? ''}}"
            },
            "structured_data": {
                "@type": "WebPage",
                "name": "{{page.data.title ?? ''}}",
                "description": "{{page.data.seo_meta?.description ?? ''}}",
                "image": "{{page.data.content_thumbnail_url ?? ''}}",
                "datePublished": "{{page.data.created_at ?? ''}}",
                "dateModified": "{{page.data.updated_at ?? ''}}"
            }
        }
    },
    "data_sources": [
        {
            "id": "page",
            "label_key": "$t:editor.data_source.page",
            "type": "api",
            "endpoint": "/api/modules/sirsoft-page/pages/{{route?.slug}}",
            "method": "GET",
            "auto_fetch": true,
            "auth_mode": "optional",
            "loading_strategy": "blocking",
            "fallback": {
                "data": null
            },
            "errorHandling": {
                "comment": "없는 페이지 — 서버가 등록 권한을 errors.abilities.can_create 로 알려 [페이지 만들기] 를 그 권한자에게만 연다",
                "404": {
                    "handler": "setState",
                    "params": {
                        "target": "local",
                        "pageCanCreate": "{{error?.errors?.abilities?.can_create === true}}"
                    }
                }
            },
            "comment": "문서 본문 — blocking 이라 이 응답 전에는 아무것도 그리지 않는다(문서 자체가 화면의 전부라 부분 노출이 뜻이 없다). 비로그인도 읽히지만 문서마다 공개 범위가 다를 수 있어 인증은 선택으로 보낸다."
        }
    ],
    "permissions": [],
    "slots": {
        "content": [
            {
                "type": "layout",
                "name": "Container",
                "responsive": {
                    "portable": {
                        "props": {
                            "className": "py-6 px-4"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "props": {
                    "className": "py-12"
                },
                "children": [
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Div",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "max-w-3xl mx-auto"
                        },
                        "children": [
                            {
                                "id": "page_content_card",
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Div",
                                "if": "{{page?.data}}",
                                "responsive": {
                                    "portable": {
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg shadow p-5"
                                        }
                                    }
                                },
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg shadow p-10"
                                },
                                "children": [
                                    {
                                        "id": "page_preview_banner",
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Div",
                                        "if": "{{page?.data?.is_preview}}",
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 px-4 py-3 rounded-md bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/30 text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-400 text-sm"
                                        },
                                        "children": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "Icon",
                                                "props": {
                                                    "name": "eye",
                                                    "className": "text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 text-sm"
                                                }
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "Span",
                                                "text": "$t:user.page.preview_banner"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Div",
                                        "responsive": {
                                            "portable": {
                                                "props": {
                                                    "className": "flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3"
                                                }
                                            }
                                        },
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-4"
                                        },
                                        "children": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "Div",
                                                "props": {
                                                    "className": "flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"
                                                },
                                                "children": [
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "H1",
                                                        "responsive": {
                                                            "portable": {
                                                                "props": {
                                                                    "className": "text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white"
                                                                }
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        "props": {
                                                            "className": "text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white"
                                                        },
                                                        "text": "{{page?.data?.title ?? ''}}"
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "Span",
                                                        "if": "{{page?.data?.abilities?.can_update === true}}",
                                                        "props": {
                                                            "className": "px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 rounded"
                                                        },
                                                        "text": "v{{page?.data?.current_version ?? 1}}"
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "id": "page_admin_edit_button",
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "A",
                                                "if": "{{page?.data?.abilities?.can_update === true}}",
                                                "props": {
                                                    "href": "/admin/pages/{{page?.data?.id}}/edit",
                                                    "className": "inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-gray-600 transition-colors no-underline"
                                                },
                                                "children": [
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "Icon",
                                                        "props": {
                                                            "name": "pencil",
                                                            "className": "text-xs"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "Span",
                                                        "text": "$t:user.page.admin_edit"
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "P",
                                        "if": "{{page?.data?.published_at}}",
                                        "responsive": {
                                            "portable": {
                                                "props": {
                                                    "className": "text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4"
                                                }
                                            }
                                        },
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6"
                                        },
                                        "text": "$t:user.page.published_at: {{page?.data?.published_at | date}}"
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "id": "page_html_content",
                                        "type": "extension_point",
                                        "name": "html_content",
                                        "props": {
                                            "content": "{{page?.data?.content ?? ''}}",
                                            "isHtml": "{{(page?.data?.content_mode ?? 'html') === 'html'}}",
                                            "className": "text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
                                        },
                                        "default": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "composite",
                                                "name": "HtmlContent",
                                                "props": {
                                                    "content": "{{page?.data?.content ?? ''}}",
                                                    "isHtml": "{{(page?.data?.content_mode ?? 'html') === 'html'}}",
                                                    "className": "text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
                                                }
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "id": "page_attachments_section",
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Div",
                                        "if": "{{(page?.data?.attachments ?? []).length > 0}}",
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700"
                                        },
                                        "children": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "Div",
                                                "props": {
                                                    "className": "flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"
                                                },
                                                "children": [
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "Icon",
                                                        "props": {
                                                            "name": "paperclip",
                                                            "className": "text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "Span",
                                                        "props": {
                                                            "className": "text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
                                                        },
                                                        "text": "$t:user.page.attachments"
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "Div",
                                                "iteration": {
                                                    "source": "page?.data?.attachments ?? []",
                                                    "item_var": "att_item",
                                                    "index_var": "att_index"
                                                },
                                                "props": {
                                                    "className": "space-y-2"
                                                },
                                                "children": [
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "Div",
                                                        "props": {
                                                            "className": "flex items-center justify-between p-3 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700/50 rounded-lg"
                                                        },
                                                        "children": [
                                                            {
                                                                "type": "basic",
                                                                "name": "Div",
                                                                "props": {
                                                                    "className": "flex items-center gap-3 min-w-0"
                                                                },
                                                                "children": [
                                                                    {
                                                                        "comment": "이미지 썸네일 (이미지 파일인 경우) - preview_url 공개 서빙",
                                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                                        "name": "Div",
                                                                        "if": "{{att_item.is_image}}",
                                                                        "props": {
                                                                            "className": "flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800"
                                                                        },
                                                                        "children": [
                                                                            {
                                                                                "type": "basic",
                                                                                "name": "Img",
                                                                                "props": {
                                                                                    "src": "{{att_item.preview_url}}",
                                                                                    "alt": "{{att_item.original_filename}}",
                                                                                    "className": "w-full h-full object-cover"
                                                                                }
                                                                            }
                                                                        ]
                                                                    },
                                                                    {
                                                                        "comment": "파일 아이콘 (일반 파일인 경우)",
                                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                                        "name": "Icon",
                                                                        "if": "{{!att_item.is_image}}",
                                                                        "props": {
                                                                            "name": "file",
                                                                            "className": "text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 text-sm flex-shrink-0"
                                                                        }
                                                                    },
                                                                    {
                                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                                        "name": "Span",
                                                                        "props": {
                                                                            "className": "text-sm text-gray-900 dark:text-white truncate"
                                                                        },
                                                                        "text": "{{att_item.original_filename}}"
                                                                    }
                                                                ]
                                                            },
                                                            {
                                                                "type": "basic",
                                                                "name": "Button",
                                                                "actions": [
                                                                    {
                                                                        "comment": "첨부 내려받기 — 링크로 열지 않고 핸들러를 거치는 것은 원래 파일명을 되살려 저장하기 위해서다(서버 저장명은 사람이 읽을 수 없다).",
                                                                        "type": "click",
                                                                        "handler": "downloadAttachment",
                                                                        "params": {
                                                                            "url": "{{att_item.download_url}}",
                                                                            "filename": "{{att_item.original_filename}}"
                                                                        }
                                                                    }
                                                                ],
                                                                "props": {
                                                                    "type": "button",
                                                                    "className": "flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline flex-shrink-0 bg-transparent border-0 cursor-pointer"
                                                                },
                                                                "children": [
                                                                    {
                                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                                        "name": "Icon",
                                                                        "props": {
                                                                            "name": "download",
                                                                            "className": "text-xs"
                                                                        }
                                                                    },
                                                                    {
                                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                                        "name": "Span",
                                                                        "text": "$t:user.page.download"
                                                                    }
                                                                ]
                                                            }
                                                        ]
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "id": "page_not_found",
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Div",
                                "if": "{{!page?.data && !page?.loading}}",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg shadow p-10 text-center"
                                },
                                "children": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Icon",
                                        "props": {
                                            "name": "circle-exclamation",
                                            "className": "text-4xl text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 mb-4"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "H2",
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2"
                                        },
                                        "text": "$t:user.page.not_found_title"
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "P",
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6"
                                        },
                                        "text": "$t:user.page.not_found_description"
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Div",
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "flex items-center justify-center gap-3"
                                        },
                                        "children": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "Button",
                                                "actions": [
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "click",
                                                        "handler": "navigate",
                                                        "params": {
                                                            "path": "/"
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                ],
                                                "props": {
                                                    "type": "button",
                                                    "className": "inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-gray-600 transition-colors"
                                                },
                                                "children": [
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "Icon",
                                                        "props": {
                                                            "name": "house",
                                                            "className": "text-sm"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "Span",
                                                        "text": "$t:user.page.back_to_home"
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "id": "page_create_button",
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "A",
                                                "if": "{{_local.pageCanCreate === true}}",
                                                "props": {
                                                    "href": "/admin/pages/create?slug={{route?.slug ?? ''}}",
                                                    "className": "inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white bg-blue-600 dark:bg-blue-500 rounded-md hover:bg-blue-700 dark:hover:bg-blue-600 transition-colors no-underline"
                                                },
                                                "children": [
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "Icon",
                                                        "props": {
                                                            "name": "plus",
                                                            "className": "text-sm"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "Span",
                                                        "text": "$t:user.page.create_page"
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "id": "page_back_button",
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Div",
                                "if": "{{page?.data}}",
                                "responsive": {
                                    "portable": {
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "mt-6 text-center"
                                        }
                                    }
                                },
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "mt-8 text-center"
                                },
                                "children": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Button",
                                        "actions": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "click",
                                                "handler": "navigate",
                                                "params": {
                                                    "path": "/"
                                                }
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "props": {
                                            "type": "button",
                                            "className": "inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-900 dark:hover:text-white cursor-pointer"
                                        },
                                        "children": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "Icon",
                                                "props": {
                                                    "name": "arrow-left",
                                                    "className": "text-sm"
                                                }
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "Span",
                                                "text": "$t:user.page.back_to_home"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    }
}
